	<div id="articleTitle" id="article_view">
		<h4 class="issue_view">Original Research</h4>
		<h3 class="abstract_title">Barriers to electronic signature adoption in South African conveyancing</h3>
	</div>
	<div id="authorString"><em>Luke Abrahams, Anthea P. Amadi-Echendu, Nonceba Ntoyanto-Tyatyantsi</em></div>
	<div>
		South African Journal of Information Management | Vol 28, No 1 | a2139 |
																			DOI: <a id="pub-id::doi" href="https://doi.org/10.4102/sajim.v28i1.2139">https://doi.org/10.4102/sajim.v28i1.2139</a>					
		
