					<div>
				<h4 style="font-weight:normal;font-size: 11px !important;">About the author(s)</h4>
							Luke Abrahams, Department of Operations Management, College of Economic and Management Sciences, University of South Africa, Pretoria, South Africa<br />							Anthea P. Amadi-Echendu, Department of Operations Management, College of Economic and Management Sciences, University of South Africa, Pretoria, South Africa<br />							Nonceba Ntoyanto-Tyatyantsi, Department of Applied Management, College of Economic and Management Sciences, University of South Africa, Pretoria, South Africa						</div>
			<br />
